Package: vkq3ng
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         libsdl2-2.0-0,
         libwayland-client0,
         libxkbcommon0,
         libx11-6,
         libxext6,
         libxcb1,
         libvulkan1,
         desktop-file-utils
Recommends: vkq3ng-data,
            libgtk-3-bin | gtk-update-icon-cache
Description: vkq3ng - Vulkan Quake 3 Next Generation engine
 Vulkan Quake 3 Next Generation (vkq3ng) is a modern Vulkan-based
 engine for Quake III Arena featuring ray-tracing support,
 Wayland native backend, SDL2 audio, and FSR-style render scaling.
 .
 This is the engine only - you must provide your own Quake III Arena
 game data (baseq3/pak0.pk3 through pak8.pk3). Place them in
 /usr/share/games/vkq3ng/baseq3/ or in ~/.vkq3ng/baseq3/.

Package: vkq3ng-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: vkq3ng - game data directory structure
 This package creates the directory structure for vkq3ng game
 data. It does not include the actual game assets (pak0.pk3 etc.),
 which must be obtained from a licensed copy of Quake III Arena.
 .
 Place your retail pak files in /usr/share/games/vkq3ng/baseq3/ or
 in ~/.vkq3ng/baseq3/.

Package: vkq3ng-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         vkq3ng (= ${binary:Version})
Description: vkq3ng dedicated server
 This package provides the dedicated server for vkq3ng.
 It uses the same engine as the client but runs in headless mode.
 Run with: vkq3ng +set dedicated 2 +set net_port 27960 +exec server.cfg

Package: q3asm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: vkq3ng - q3asm VM compiler
 This package provides q3asm, the virtual machine assembly compiler
 used for compiling vkq3ng game logic (qagame, cgame, ui).
 Installed to /usr/lib/vkq3ng/q3asm.